' S-514: ROL/ROR her tamsayi genisliginde kendi genisligi icinde doner (8/16/32 bit) ve sayim genislige gore mod alinir.
' WASM eskiden hicbir tipte calismiyor, hep 0 yaziyordu. (U32'nin 2^31 ustu degerlerini yazdirma ayri kayittir: S-216.)
DIM a AS U8 = 129
PRINT a ROL 1
PRINT a ROR 1
DIM s AS I8 = -127
PRINT s ROL 1
PRINT s ROR 1
DIM b AS U16 = 32769
PRINT b ROL 1
PRINT b ROR 1
DIM t AS I16 = -32767
PRINT t ROL 1
PRINT t ROR 1
DIM c AS U32 = 2147483649
PRINT c ROL 1
DIM i AS I32 = -2147483647
PRINT i ROL 1
PRINT i ROR 1
DIM d AS U32 = 1
PRINT (d ROR 1) SHR 30
DIM n AS I32 = 20
PRINT n ROL 33
PRINT n ROR 33
